- Non-clinician emotional/conversational “we didn’t know …” that is not a missing clinical fact relevant to handover (e.g., family: “we didn’t know how bad things were”).
- Statements where the unknown target is not concretely specified in the quote itself (avoid extracting underspecified fragments).

