What to extract (VERY strict):
Extract ONLY statements where the speaker explicitly declares missing knowledge / inability to confirm a specific fact right now. These must be clear “I/we don’t know / can’t confirm / unsure” type declarations.

Count as “Unknown fact” ONLY if it is explicit, e.g.:
- “I don’t know his allergies.”
